WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.775 --> 00:00:13.615
Roxy looked down.

2
00:00:14.455 --> 00:00:16.796
The purple slime made her feet stick to the street!

3
00:00:18.556 --> 00:00:21.097
"Grr!" Roxy used her super strength.

4
00:00:22.417 --> 00:00:26.899
She pulled, heaved, and twisted until—shloop!—her feet came unstuck.

5
00:00:28.199 --> 00:00:31.100
By now the aliens had opened the door of the pizza delivery truck.

6
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:34.560
"Yikes!" the driver shouted.

7
00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:37.241
"Stop right there!"

8
00:00:37.641 --> 00:00:39.942
Roxy shouted as she flew toward the aliens.

9
00:00:39.962 --> 00:00:43.563
"I'm not going to let you hurt him."

10
00:00:43.583 --> 00:00:48.404
"We aren't going to hurt anyone," said one alien.

11
00:00:48.424 --> 00:00:50.445
"My name is Brim.

12
00:00:50.465 --> 00:00:54.126
We need to refuel our spaceship.

13
00:00:55.186 --> 00:00:58.627
It runs on food, but none of this food is working."

14
00:00:58.647 --> 00:01:00.867
"Why not?"

15
00:01:01.308 --> 00:01:01.928
asked Roxy.

16
00:01:03.324 --> 00:01:06.746
"It's not the right kind of food," said Brim.

17
00:01:08.386 --> 00:01:11.428
"We need something really thick and gloppy."

18
00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:16.550
and gloppy?"

19
00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:17.650
said Roxy.

20
00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:26.954
"Hmm said Mara.

21
00:01:27.875 --> 00:01:30.256
"I got sloppy joe on my sleeve!"

22
00:01:31.976 --> 00:01:34.097
"This is awful," said Jack.

23
00:01:35.098 --> 00:01:38.320
Just then Brim and the other aliens walked into the cafeteria.

24
00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:41.742
"Aliens!" someone shouted.

25
00:01:41.762 --> 00:01:44.203
"Run for your life!"

26
00:01:44.703 --> 00:01:45.684
shouted someone else.

27
00:01:48.465 --> 00:01:49.566
Rocket Girl flew in.

28
00:01:49.586 --> 00:01:52.868
"Don't panic," she said.

29
00:01:52.888 --> 00:01:55.249
"These guys are friendly.

30
00:01:56.190 --> 00:01:59.772
They just need your sloppy joes so they can refuel their spaceship."

31
00:02:00.744 --> 00:02:03.865
Rocket Girl explained everything, and no one was scared anymore.

32
00:02:03.885 --> 00:02:07.866
"Oh! You can have my sloppy joe!"

33
00:02:08.306 --> 00:02:08.906
said Jack.

34
00:02:08.926 --> 00:02:11.087
"Mine too!"

35
00:02:11.487 --> 00:02:12.147
said Mara.

36
00:02:12.167 --> 00:02:14.088
"Take mine!"

37
00:02:14.548 --> 00:02:15.208
said Terrell.

38
00:02:15.228 --> 00:02:20.129
"Everybody, grab your lunch and follow us," said Rocket Girl.

39
00:02:26.451 --> 00:02:28.151
it now, Brim," said Roxy.

40
00:02:29.012 --> 00:02:30.492
Brim started up the spaceship.

41
00:02:31.664 --> 00:02:32.685
It worked perfectly.

42
00:02:32.705 --> 00:02:36.588
"Thank you, everyone," said Brim.

43
00:02:36.608 --> 00:02:41.372
"Those sloppy joes are the perfect fuel for our spaceship."

44
00:02:43.854 --> 00:02:46.496
The kids waved good-bye as the spaceship flew away.

45
00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:53.943
glad we got rid of those sloppy joes," said Terrell.

46
00:02:53.963 --> 00:02:56.485
"But now what will we eat?"

47
00:02:58.586 --> 00:03:00.208
"Look out the window!"

48
00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:01.261
said Mara.

49
00:03:01.281 --> 00:03:04.723
"Pizza!" said Jack.

50
00:03:05.704 --> 00:03:07.585
Mayor Bloom came into the cafeteria.

51
00:03:08.726 --> 00:03:10.447
He had a tall stack of pizzas.

52
00:03:10.467 --> 00:03:15.931
"Thanks for giving up your lunches to save Metro City," he said.

53
00:03:15.951 --> 00:03:18.733
"I have pizza for everybody."

54
00:03:19.553 --> 00:03:22.055
The students cheered.

55
00:03:23.896 --> 00:03:26.138
A moment later Roxy entered the cafeteria.

56
00:03:27.619 --> 00:03:29.080
"Roxy!" said Mara.

57
00:03:29.928 --> 00:03:31.289
"You missed Rocket Girl!"

58
00:03:31.309 --> 00:03:33.651
"And aliens!"

59
00:03:34.232 --> 00:03:34.832
said Jack.

60
00:03:34.852 --> 00:03:38.836
"What?" asked Roxy, pretending to be surprised.

61
00:03:38.856 --> 00:03:40.818
"Where were you?"

62
00:03:41.258 --> 00:03:41.839
asked Mara.

63
00:03:41.859 --> 00:03:48.705
"Oh, I was helping Principal Penn with office work," said Roxy.

64
00:03:49.825 --> 00:03:51.747
Terrell looked at Roxy suspiciously.

65
00:03:51.767 --> 00:03:54.910
"Well, you know what, Roxy?

66
00:03:56.031 --> 00:03:56.992
You were wrong.

67
00:03:57.977 --> 00:04:01.604
Rocket Girl was able to save us from sloppy joe day."

68
00:04:02.887 --> 00:04:04.170
Roxy didn't say anything.

69
00:04:05.132 --> 00:04:08.299
She just smiled and quietly reached for a slice of pizza.
